# Normalise line endings to LF in the repo (Windows checkouts may use CRLF).
# The sibling site repositories carry no .gitattributes, so a site scaffolded on
# Windows lands CRLF in git and every later diff from a Unix machine is a whole-file
# rewrite. One line prevents that.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
